    "text": "def solution(lst):\n    \"\"\"Given a non-empty list of integers, return the sum of all of the odd elements that are even positions.\"\"\"\n\n    result = 0\n    for \n    for i in enumerate(l_lst):\n        if i % 2 == 0 and lst[i_] % 2 != 0:\n            result += lst[i]\n    return result\n\n#",
